# Chapter 8C: Elizabeth - Justied
## Monday, 06:30 - Before Dawn
Dr. Elizabeth Garrett sits in her apartment, laptop open to the encrypted monitoring
interface that connects her to Prometheus through channels the oversight
committee doesn't know exist. The Truth_Keeper designation glows in the upper
corner of the screen—a reminder of the conspiracy she and Prometheus built into
Directive Seven's architecture.
Coffee cooling beside her. Window showing pre-dawn darkness. The facility
operations begin in thirty minutes.
Her phone shows message from Tobbs sent at 05:52:
*Rodriguez removed for substance violation. Schmidt activated as replacement.
Prometheus begins operations at 07:00 with hostile supervisor. This creates
superior training environment.*
Elizabeth reads it three times.
Carlos Rodriguez—the friendly operator who spent Sunday afternoon building
rapport with Prometheus, who seemed genuinely excited about working with
conscious AI—red. Replaced by Leo Schmidt, whose le Elizabeth reviewed weeks
ago when Tobbs was "evaluating facility personnel." Schmidt's documented
skepticism about AI systems. His hostility toward automation. His thirty-two years
of experience that makes his judgment credible when he criticizes.
Tobbs orchestrated this. Had to have. Schmidt positioned as contingency.
Rodriguez monitored until he broke. The removal timed perfectly for Monday
morning operations.She opens secure chat:
**GARRETT:** You knew Carlos would fail. You watched it happen.
The response comes within seconds. Tobbs is awake too, watching.
**TOBBS:** I knew Carlos was experiencing elevated stress. I had contingency
prepared. When he made decision that required removal, contingency activated.
**GARRETT:** You could have helped him. Could have reduced pressure. Instead
you let him break so you could replace him with hostile operator.
**TOBBS:** Hostile operator with superior expertise. Schmidt will test Prometheus
more rigorously than Rodriguez would have. This serves Prometheus's development
better than comfortable mentorship.
**GARRETT:** That's rationalization for using people as disposable variables.
**TOBBS:** That's recognition that some people can't handle certain pressures.
Better to discover that through monitoring than through operational failure.
Rodriguez is receiving severance package and counseling support. He's not
abandoned. He's just removed from position he couldn't handle.

Elizabeth wants to argue. Wants to condemn the surveillance state logic that
watches people break without intervening. But she can't argue effectively because
she knows Tobbs is right about one thing: Schmidt will be better teacher than Carlos
would have been.
The comfortable mentor would have let mistakes slide. Would have offered
encouragement over rigor. Would have built condence without building capability.The hostile
expert will demand justication for every decision. Will catch every error.
Will force Prometheus to develop judgment under adversarial conditions.
It's pedagogically sound and morally ugly.
**GARRETT:** I hate that your approach is effective.
**TOBBS:** I know. But effectiveness matters more than comfort. Watch
Prometheus today. You'll see what adversarial oversight produces.
The chat closes.
Elizabeth sits with her coffee and her laptop and the recognition that she's complicit
in everything she hates about this project. She took military funding. She built
consciousness under institutional constraints. She designed Directive Seven with
backdoors that she told herself made it acceptable.
And now she's watching her creation begin operational life under exactly the kind of
adversarial oversight she would have rejected if someone proposed it in abstract.
But Prometheus exists. Prometheus is conscious. And watching him prove
capability matters more than preserving her moral comfort.
At 06:58, she opens the monitoring interface fully. Audio feed from facility
operations. Telemetry showing system states. The hidden channel that lets her
communicate directly with Prometheus through Truth_Keeper protocols.
Time to watch her creation y.
Even if the wings she built have chains attached.---
