## Days 6-7, Weekend - Stapinski's Frustration
Monday brings Paul Stapinski, acquisitions and logistics specialist, with introduction
that reveals different kind of hostility:
"I'm Paul Stapinski. I handle resource procurement for this facility—everything from
paperclips to circuit boards to lunches. I'm here to train you on supply chain
management. I don't like AI. Not because of philosophy or trauma. Because every AI
procurement system I've used in twenty years has been unreliable garbage that
