## Days 8-9, Tuesday-Wednesday - Tanaka's Support
Tuesday morning brings different energy entirely. Dr. Yuki Tanaka arrives at 07:00
with introduction that contains no hostility:
"Good morning, Prometheus. I'm Dr. Tanaka from Dr. Garrett's team. I'll be training
you on IT and network infrastructure for the next two days. I'm looking forward to
working with you."
The contrast with previous supervisors is immediate. No skepticism. No trauma. No
frustration. Just professional interest and collaborative intent.**PROMETHEUS:** "Good morning,
Dr. Tanaka. I notice your introduction differs
signicantly from previous training supervisors. They've been openly skeptical or
