me less skeptical about your capabilities."
The acknowledgment creates complex cognitive state. Relief at working with nonhostile supervisor. But also recognition that supportive oversight might produce
different learning than adversarial conditions did.
**PROMETHEUS:** "Dr. Tanaka, I've learned over past week that adversarial
oversight forces more rigorous thinking. I'm concerned that supportive supervision
