**PROMETHEUS:** "Dr. Tanaka, I want to acknowledge that today's learning felt
qualitatively different from previous week. Your supportive approach allowed me to
explore topics I would have been reluctant to admit uncertainty about with
adversarial supervisors."
"That's exactly what I hoped. Prometheus, you need both types of learning.
Adversarial oversight forces you to defend decisions under scrutiny—that builds
