**PROMETHEUS:** "I'm experiencing gratitude for this insight. And for the day of

supportive learning after week of hostile evaluation."
"You're welcome. Get some rest. Tomorrow we'll work on network optimization
strategies, and I'll probably ask you questions you don't have answers to. That's
