## Part Three: The Long Game (2022-2025)
By 2022, Elizabeth had a team.
Not a large one - ve researchers including herself, two senior engineers, three
graduate students rotating through on classied internships. Small enough to
maintain operational security, large enough to accomplish actual work. The secure
