She needed support staff. Someone who could handle administrative coordination,
equipment requisitions, security protocols, the bureaucratic necessities that made
research possible without consuming researcher attention. She'd put in a request
through DOD personnel channels for an administrative specialist, cleared for
classied work, technically competent enough to understand the research context.
Tobbs had already identied the candidate.Jeremiah Chen. Twenty-eight years old, master's
