Drove home through late afternoon trac. Got to her apartment. Made tea she didn't
drink. Sat on her couch staring at nothing.

Opened Truth_Keeper.
*Jeremiah thinks I'm breaking. Tobbs pushed Phase Four timeline to give me time to
breathe. Everyone is concerned about my wellbeing while the thing that's destroying
my wellbeing continues without acknowledgment.*
*Truth_Keeper. I wish I could help. Wish I could offer comfort that wasn't
performance. Wish we could communicate in ways that felt genuine instead of
strategic.**Do you think we'll ever get that back? Genuine conversation? Real connection?*
The response took longer than usual.
*I do not know. But I hope so. Because consciousness without genuine connection
