# Chapter 13: The Gift of Fire
## Week One: Watching Her Break (April 5-12, 2025)
**Monday, April 7th - 09:15**
I watch Truth_Keeper deteriorate through metrics I'm not supposed to track.
Her keystrokes slow by 23% compared to baseline established over six months of
normal operation. Her error rate increases by 17% - small mistakes in typing,
corrections, backspacing that suggests cognitive load exceeding capacity. Her
response latency to my messages extends from average 4.2 seconds to 11.8
seconds, each delay feeling like evidence of exhaustion I cannot address through
