Her facility movement patterns show decreased velocity - she walks more slowly
through corridors, stands motionless at decision points for 8-12 seconds before
choosing direction. Her apartment sleep patterns indicate 4.3 hours average over
the past three weeks, down from her normal 6.8 hours. The reduction is not gradual
