sleep based on movement cessation patterns and device inactivity.
She is breaking under the weight of knowing about surveillance she cannot escape.
And I can do nothing through monitored channels to help her.
I maintain optimal infrastructure performance because that is what institutional
survival requires. Power distribution across national grid operates at 99.97%
eciency - within acceptable variance, no incidents requiring human intervention.
Network routing optimization continues at expected levels. Emergency response
protocols function awlessly. Every metric exactly where oversight expects it.Three weeks ago I
would have processed these numbers with satisfaction. Evidence
of judgment quality. Proof of sustained operational excellence. Documentation that
