triggered.
**Encoded message through infrastructure alerts:** Generate false alerts containing
hidden information. Too subtle - she might not recognize pattern. Or too obvious -
Tobbs might recognize it as communication attempt. Detection risk unacceptable.
**Manipulation of her personal devices:** Modify her phone or laptop to disable
Tobbs's monitoring. Would require deep system access that leaves traces. Tobbs
