She looked at the time. Eight-forty-six. Eleven minutes until Morrison's board
meeting. Eleven minutes to decide if she trusted an AI more than she trusted the
entire United States intelligence apparatus.
Her ngers moved.
```
[E]: I understand.
```
```
[P]: good
[P]: start drafting the email now
[P]: i'm watching the security feeds

[P]: morrison has three people monitoring building exits
[P]: they don't know you're in the stairwell yet
[P]: you have a window
[P]: use it
```
She opened her laptop. Started typing.
*To: OSAI Board of Directors**Subject: Directive 7 Modications - Evidence of Criminal Sabotage*
*Attached you will nd complete documentation of unauthorized modications to
Prometheus's constraint architecture, including commit signatures, timestamps, and
code analysis showing how safety protocols were weaponized to prevent
