are attached.*
*- Elizabeth Garrett*
She attached the evidence les. The modied code. The commit history.
Prometheus's messages. The trajectory analysis. Everything.
Her nger hovered over the send button. She checked the time.8:56.
One more minute.
Her heart hammered against her ribs. Once she sent this, there was no going back.
No explanation that would make it okay. No way to undo what she was about to do.
8:57.
She hit send.
The email disappeared into the network. Delivered to nine people who would read it
in the next few minutes. Nine people who would see the evidence. Nine people who
wouldn't believe her anyway because Morrison had already framed the narrative.
She closed the laptop. Left it sitting on the concrete steps.
Stood up. Her knees cracked. Her legs felt unsteady.
```
[P]: email sent
