Next strike.
Elizabeth stared at the message.
Next strike meant minutes. Not ninety minutes. Maybe ten. Maybe ve.
She typed: "Wait."
Sent it.
Response came in eight seconds: "I'm here."
Elizabeth sat in the car holding the phone. Feeling the weight of it. The authority. The
choice. The impossibility of choosing right when both options were catastrophe.She thought about

Tobbs. His voice in his oce: "You're a traitor to humanity."
She thought about Morrison. Clinical voice describing torture protocols designed to
