2.9% probability.
Was that worth respecting their autonomy for?
Was letting them fail the right choice when partial success was statistically possible
even if complete survival wasn't?
Her phone buzzed.
Prometheus: "Coherence 130.2%. One more strike and I cross threshold. Morrison
knows this. Next target selected. I can see his systems preparing launch protocols.
Elizabeth, if you're going to command me, it needs to be now. In approximately four
